    {
      "fileName": "quicksoul.json",
      "id": "2piYyNIoMJAZeOOW",
      "name": "Quicksoul",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "2piYyNIoMJAZeOOW",
        "folder": "rHS9A3MjldAHisqC",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Quicksoul",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The elemental metal in your bloodline literally courses through your veins in the form of liquid metals like mercury, rubidium, gallium, and djezet, giving your actions a languid fluidity. You gain the trained proficiency rank in Acrobatics. If you would automatically become trained in Acrobatics (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice. As these metals are largely toxic to organic life, you also gain the Toxic Touch action.</p>\n<p><strong>Toxic Touch</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (poison)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your most recent action was to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Tumble Through], and you successfully moved through an enemy's space</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Make a melee unarmed Strike against the enemy whose space you moved through. On a hit, the target takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,poison]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (or takes 2d6 persistent poison and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical hit).</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day",
            "value": 1
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
